{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Frequently Asked Questions"}], "prev": {"link": "../sqlite3-interfaceerror-error-binding-parameter/", "title": "sqlite3.InterfaceError: Error binding parameter"}, "next": {"link": "../how-to-avoid-flood-waits/", "title": "How to avoid Flood Waits?"}, "title": "socket.send(), OSError(), TimeoutError(), Connection lost/reset", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"socket-send-oserror-timeouterror-connection-lost-reset\">\n<h1>socket.send(), OSError(), TimeoutError(), Connection lost/reset<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#socket-send-oserror-timeouterror-connection-lost-reset\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>If you get any of these errors chances are you ended up with a slow or inconsistent network connection.\nAnother reason could be because you are blocking the event loop for too long.</p>\n<p>You can consider the following:</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Use Pyrogram asynchronously in its intended way.</p></li>\n<li><p>Use shorter non-asynchronous processing loops.</p></li>\n<li><p>Use <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">asyncio.sleep()</span></code> instead of <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">time.sleep()</span></code>.</p></li>\n<li><p>Use a stable network connection.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["faq/how-to-avoid-flood-waits", "How to avoid Flood Waits?", "N", "next"], ["faq/sqlite3-interfaceerror-error-binding-parameter", "sqlite3.InterfaceError: Error binding parameter", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">socket.send(), OSError(), TimeoutError(), Connection lost/reset</a></li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": false, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "faq/socket-send-oserror-timeouterror-connection-lost-reset", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": true, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}